			"date": "2024-07-17T14:34:07.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Most smart home tech is light bulbs so you can dim them from your sofa and go “RED LIGHT DISTRICT INIT” and impress guests for exactly once because you can tell they’re not impressed.</p>",
