			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Responsibility is always an option:</p><p><a href=\"https://sensorsandsensibility.com/posts/2016/1/20/progressively-enhanced-homes\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">sensorsandsensibility.com/post</span><span class=\"invisible\">s/2016/1/20/progressively-enhanced-homes</span></a></p>",
