		{
			"id": "112802348894725323",
			"parentId": "112802324071244151",
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@timsev/112802348796529030",
			"author": {
				"name": "Tim Severien",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@timsev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/288/338/141/483/533/original/253f6de61dd10af0.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-17T14:40:46.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> That being said, I do have some smart stuff, but reject anything cloud-based, and only use them for optionalish stuff that needs power anyway. It’s a progressive enhancement!</p><p>Basically, I dim lights from my sofa. And my partner trolls me by turning off the lights of the room I’m in.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112802368393941981",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://mastodon.social/@joshwayne/112802366488610844",
			"author": {
				"name": "Josh Wayne",
				"url": "https://mastodon.social/@joshwayne",
				"avatarUrl": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/avatars/original/missing.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-07-17T14:45:16.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> The parallels go even deeper because the solutions in home automation also look like the same we use for websites.</p><p>Power goes out 👉 automated devices still have physical switches as falllbacks.</p><p>Smart lock fails 👉 physical key backup + only ran it locally so it was less prone to failure in the first place (planned fallbacks)</p><p>Company went out of business 👉 doesn't matter because I used an open source, local solution and never connected to their cloud anyway (reduced dependencies)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112802399763136567",
			"parentId": "112802368393941981",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/112802399763136567",
			"author": {
