			},
			"date": "2024-07-17T14:53:43.730Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@joshwayne\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>joshwayne</span></a></span> yeah! These things can be designed responsibly—but most often are not 😬</p>",
